// note: under the France role, customers by sales band with CROSSFILTER BOTH on the Sales-Customer relationship, its columns given one-side first: the role's filter on Customer would reach Sales and come back to Customer itself (a DAX error: two join paths from Customer to Customer)
// expect: error
// roles: France
EVALUATE
ADDCOLUMNS(
    VALUES(Segments[Segment]),
    "Customers", [Segment Customer Count],
    "Customers Via Sales", CALCULATE([Segment Customer Count], CROSSFILTER(Customer[CustomerKey], Sales[CustomerKey], BOTH))
)
ORDER BY Segments[Segment]
